  "id": "experiment",
  "term": "experiment",
  "definition": "An experiment is a way of gaining knowledge by deliberately changing conditions or the way phenomena are observed. In psychology, it is presented as a special form of observation in which the observer intentionally interferes with the course of what is being studied to reduce accidental influences and test conclusions against the facts.",
